Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.74,0:00:08.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yukako Yamagishi has been\Nfeeling a bit crestfallen lately.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.02,0:00:11.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You have a crush on someone?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.84,0:00:14.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, and I think they\Nlike me too! Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.56,0:00:20.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You'll never guess what happened\Nwhile I was at Angelo's Rock!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.24,0:00:21.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tell us!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.15,0:00:23.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,These tourists were taking\Npictures and freaking out over it!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.52,0:00:25.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who knew it would be such a hotspot?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.66,0:00:30.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh, Koichi? You okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.72,0:00:37.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As long as Koichi is in my\Nheart, that's all I need.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.48,0:00:41.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,At least that's what I used to\Nthink, until the pain set in.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.42,0:00:45.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If only he'd look at me,\Neven a glance would suffice.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.42,0:00:47.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have no idea what I'm supposed to do.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:50.19,0:00:52.19,Note,Sign,0,0,0,,Note: "Makeup that will help you find your one true love."
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.38,0:00:53.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Cinderella?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.82,0:01:01.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is the best day ever!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.20,0:01:05.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't believe that Hang\NDreamboat actually proposed to me!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.94,0:01:07.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're incredible, Dr. Aya!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.78,0:01:09.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you so much for everything!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.28,0:01:14.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Her youth will be spent\Nas a cheerful troll.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.26,0:01:17.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Better that than a doleful beauty.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.40,0:01:18.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, the things we endure.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.82,0:01:20.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come in.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.76,0:01:23.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As you can see, our makeover\Nwill help you find true love.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.94,0:01:25.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's our personal guarantee.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.88,0:01:27.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Though the choice is yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.14,0:01:41.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is Beauty Institute Cinderella.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:39.82,0:01:44.41,Title Part 4,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(648,643)\pos(143,900)\fs60}Episode 20: {\fs80} Yamagishi Yukako's Cinderella Fantasy
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.42,0:01:44.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please don't be shy.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.78,0:01:46.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My name is Aya Tsuji.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.04,0:01:50.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm the principal owner and esthetician.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.76,0:01:54.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And don't worry, I'm not\Nas apathetic as I sound.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.60,0:01:58.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm actually very\Npassionate about my work.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.28,0:02:03.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Goodness.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.52,0:02:06.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You have such a lovely face. Gorgeous.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.12,0:02:11.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,To think such a striking beauty was\Nhiding right here in little old Mariah.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.26,0:02:14.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now then, come in and have a seat.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.52,0:02:18.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,First, I'll need you to fill out\Na form with your name and address.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.40,0:02:21.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hold on, I haven't decided to go\Nthrough with whatever this is.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.68,0:02:23.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Of course, here's our list of services.
