Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.90,0:02:26.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Marry a celebrity makeover?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.00,0:02:30.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My institute is a bit of a\Ndeparture from the mainstream.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.54,0:02:34.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You could describe my work as\Nconstructing visages of good fortune.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.92,0:02:38.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,One's physiognomy,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.22,0:02:43.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,that is, the form of one's face, is\Nwhat essentially dictates one's luck.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.26,0:02:47.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Which means a face welcoming of love\Nincreases your chances of finding love.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.40,0:02:49.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's such a pity.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.86,0:02:53.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your eyes and eyebrows were\Ncursed with an unlucky shape.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.22,0:02:55.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll be straight with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.80,0:02:58.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This was the shittiest\Npitch I've ever heard.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.16,0:02:59.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You really charge for this crap?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.82,0:03:01.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,With features like these, my dear,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.74,0:03:05.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the stronger your affection for a\Nboy, the harder he'll pull back.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.20,0:03:09.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Judging by your face, we've\Nreached the heart of the matter.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.20,0:03:11.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're what's the matter.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.38,0:03:13.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That has never happened in my life.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.26,0:03:14.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh no?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.17,0:03:15.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You'll have to forgive me then.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.70,0:03:17.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,At any rate, let's dive in.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.40,0:03:20.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Pardon the in-between stages.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.30,0:03:22.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I haven't quite mastered\Ncomputer graphics.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.74,0:03:26.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is a face that will find true love.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.58,0:03:27.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hang on a second.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.80,0:03:29.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is this for plastic surgery?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.58,0:03:31.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is that what you do here? No, dear.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.00,0:03:34.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll achieve this effect with\Nonly makeup and a beauty massage.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.00,0:03:37.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But be aware you only have 30 minutes.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.64,0:03:41.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you don't find love within that\Ntime, I will refund your thousand yen.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.50,0:03:42.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Shall we give it a go?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.04,0:03:45.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sure, but just the makeup.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.88,0:03:49.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I suppose I'll humor you this\Nonce, but no funny business.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.18,0:03:52.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Much obliged.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.09,0:03:53.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's begin, shall we?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.80,0:03:55.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now, please close your eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.34,0:04:00.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't spoil the surprise by peeking, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.70,0:04:04.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And whatever you do, stay perfectly still.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.62,0:04:09.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you start wiggling around, my hands\Ncould slip and we don't want that, do we?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.72,0:04:13.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Koichi...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.04,0:04:17.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Will this really help me find true love?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.12,0:04:20.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I just don't see how\Nchanging the contours of
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.56,0:04:23.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,my eyes and eyebrows\Ncould alter my chances.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.80,0:04:26.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Koichi?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.86,0:04:29.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've been looking all\Nover town for you, Yukako.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.70,0:04:30.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Me?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.76,0:04:31.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.67,0:04:34.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Earlier, I saw you walking past Rengate.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.34,0:04:37.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You looked so down in the dumps\NI got a little worried and...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.22,0:04:39.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, I thought I'd make\Nsure everything was okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.02,0:04:40.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Koichi.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.12,0:04:43.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Koichi, you really went out of\Nyour way just to check on me?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.06,0:04:45.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.18,0:04:48.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know a lot has happened between us,\Nbut that's all water under the bridge.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.92,0:04:51.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I sincerely want you to be happy. Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.82,0:04:52.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you mean that?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.90,0:04:53.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I do.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.28,0:04:56.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't believe this is happening.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.30,0:04:57.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Could it be the makeup?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.30,0:05:00.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So, uh,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.32,0:05:02.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Koichi, instead of just\Nstanding around here,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.00,0:05:05.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,why don't we find a quiet place to chat?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.16,0:05:05.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.58,0:05:08.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you want, it's your decision.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.68,0:05:13.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You know, come to think of it, all that\Nsearching has made me a little thirsty.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.44,0:05:14.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh? Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.16,0:05:17.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's actually working.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.82,0:05:19.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Things are starting to change.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.16,0:05:23.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sharing a table with my\Nadorable yet tenacious Koichi.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.96,0:05:26.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Though it's not the manliest choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.08,0:05:27.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's incredibly manly.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.84,0:05:30.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was thinking about\Nordering the same thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.56,0:05:34.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's like I'm dreaming that\Nphysiognomy stuff works wonders.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.28,0:05:35.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can feel it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.66,0:05:38.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My luck is finally taking\Na turn for the better.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.62,0:05:48.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is this really happening?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.16,0:05:52.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can feel his heartbeat,\Nthe warmth of his body.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.18,0:05:55.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This must be what heaven feels like.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.36,0:05:57.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've never been happier in my entire life.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.28,0:05:59.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, look at the time.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.70,0:06:00.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's already four.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.28,0:06:03.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.62,0:06:06.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why does my stomach feel\Nlike it's about to explode?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.30,0:06:08.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This isn't going to end well.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.10,0:06:09.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sorry, Yukako.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.14,0:06:10.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've got to go home right now!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.02,0:06:12.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yukoichi, please don't!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.16,0:06:20.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's not fair!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.98,0:06:25.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why does it only last\Nfor a measly 30 minutes?!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.56,0:06:30.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Damn it, lady!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.58,0:06:31.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Can't you see it's a red light?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.92,0:06:33.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stuff it up your ass, douche!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.18,0:06:34.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's not my fault the\Nfrickin' light turned red.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.98,0:06:37.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why does it only work\Nfor a measly 30 minutes?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.82,0:06:39.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do something to make it last longer!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.94,0:06:41.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You found love, didn't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.26,0:06:43.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Be happy with that for now.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.36,0:06:46.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can come back to see me tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.28,0:06:49.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's what my other customers\Ndo in cases like these.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.24,0:06:50.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Never!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.15,0:06:54.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A fate that rips me away from Koichi after\N30 minutes is a fate I refuse to endure!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.04,0:06:58.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I want the win-your-soul-mate\Ntreatment! Can you do it?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.88,0:07:00.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Graciousness isn't your\Nstrong suit, is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.92,0:07:02.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Can you do it or not?!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.44,0:07:04.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, dear Yukako,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.90,0:07:07.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Cinderella may have been mistreated,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.08,0:07:10.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but found true love because\Nshe never lost her pure soul.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.64,0:07:15.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She's proof that fortune favors those who\Nkeep an open mind and a willing heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.12,0:07:17.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you have the courage to do that?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.12,0:07:18.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A willing heart?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.30,0:07:19.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What does that mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.76,0:07:22.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you truly wish to transform your luck,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.32,0:07:25.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,it'll take more than mere\Nphysiognomic alteration.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.16,0:07:27.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When I was a child,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.74,0:07:30.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I loved Cinderella's\Nfairy godmother so much
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.18,0:07:32.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,she inspired me to become an esthetician.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.44,0:07:36.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Like her, I'm dedicating my life to\Nthe service of others by giving joy.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.90,0:07:41.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yukako, you're the apple of my eye, so\NI'll help to make your dream come true.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.20,0:07:46.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,However, we'll need to include more\Nthan just your face in the treatment.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.38,0:07:56.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.29,0:07:58.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,only a full body treatment will do,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.26,0:08:00.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,so consider it part of the\NWin Your Soulmate package.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.78,0:08:04.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Use this as an emblem of the\Nwilling heart that beats within you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.56,0:08:09.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Apply this lipstick every 30 minutes,\Nexcluding the hours you're asleep, of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.26,0:08:11.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It preserves the potency of the treatment.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.56,0:08:13.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Maintain this ritual,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.00,0:08:17.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and you will have the chance to hold\Non to your soulmate for eternity.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.06,0:08:20.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's 72,000 yen for 24 hours.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.18,0:08:23.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Alright, let's just do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.72,0:08:27.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Very good.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.16,0:08:29.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stay absolutely still.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.74,0:08:32.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, and be sure to keep those eyes shut.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.24,0:08:37.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Called it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.15,0:08:39.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I knew you weren't some\Nordinary beautician.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.76,0:08:45.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You have powers, and you can see\Nmy Cinderella as well, can't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.46,0:08:47.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now I get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.82,0:08:49.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're a stand user like me.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.76,0:08:53.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But to be honest, I couldn't\Ncare less about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.72,0:08:57.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you were planning to eliminate me,\Nyou would have done so a long time ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.46,0:08:59.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I trust you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.30,0:09:01.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Work your magic, Fairy Godmother.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.26,0:09:03.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You startled me there.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.66,0:09:06.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.68,0:09:07.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Start the treatment.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.64,0:09:10.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Such a sublime girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.82,0:09:11.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's begin.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.88,0:09:13.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Know that you're in great hands.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.56,0:09:23.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Cinderella has the ability to\Ntransform the body's appearance.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.52,0:09:27.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Its power gives my win-your-soul-mate\Ntreatment that extra kick.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.70,0:09:28.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yukako, dear.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.80,0:09:32.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Bathe in your new beauty as you\Nhave become invincible in love.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.60,0:09:37.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This doesn't make any sense.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.44,0:09:39.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My stomach suddenly feels better.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.24,0:09:40.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the heck?!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.15,0:09:41.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is Yukako's bag!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.42,0:09:44.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Shoot, I have to hurry\Nand get it back to her!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.90,0:09:50.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hi, Koichi.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.88,0:09:52.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ya... Yukako...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.04,0:10:00.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.32,0:10:02.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Before I forget, here.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.94,0:10:05.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Guess I must have picked\Nup your bag by mistake.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.32,0:10:08.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This one's mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.38,0:10:10.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The whole thing was my fault. I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.72,0:10:13.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, see you later!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.44,0:10:15.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Koichi, please don't run off just yet!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.90,0:10:16.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look at me!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.86,0:10:21.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Really, look at me!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.42,0:10:24.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't I rouse any special\Nfeeling in you? Any at all?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.54,0:10:28.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, you know, I think... maybe.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.94,0:10:32.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Would you look at that, it's Koichi.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.72,0:10:33.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Rohan-sensei!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.54,0:10:37.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm heading over to Kameyu to\Ndo a little bit of research.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.90,0:10:39.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you want to keep me company?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.56,0:10:42.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'd like to, but I\Nreally need to head home.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.34,0:10:45.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't go around snapping\Nphotos at the mall by myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.00,0:10:46.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What went wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.91,0:10:47.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's leaving!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.40,0:10:51.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wasn't I supposed to become\Nan invincible heroine of love?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.66,0:10:53.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What happened to Cinderella's powers?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.32,0:10:55.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,because right now this mission is a dud!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.14,0:11:00.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Rest assured, Koichi has already\Nfallen madly in love with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.52,0:11:04.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But his rational mind is\Nresisting his heart's impulses.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.52,0:11:06.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Did something happen between you two?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.30,0:11:08.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That might be the source of the problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.94,0:11:09.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh my!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.94,0:11:11.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is this the manga artist?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.44,0:11:12.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's wonderful to meet you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.74,0:11:14.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Everything's going to be fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.52,0:11:17.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Soon enough, the tables\Nwill turn in your favor.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.70,0:11:19.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Cinderella's power's absolute.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.48,0:11:21.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And so you know it's currently 4.45.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.74,0:11:24.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your 30 minutes have almost expired.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.44,0:11:27.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's imperative you remember\Nto apply the lipstick.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.14,0:11:27.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.06,0:11:29.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm putting it on now.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.34,0:11:33.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The tables are going to\Nturn in my favor, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.64,0:11:34.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.55,0:11:35.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're going to Kama you?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.70,0:11:37.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, that's funny, so are we! Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.20,0:11:39.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the hell's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.96,0:11:41.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's like a damn block party.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.78,0:11:44.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And to make matters even more\Nawkward, his mother is here!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.62,0:11:46.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The tables will turn in your favor.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.10,0:11:48.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My ass they will!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.88,0:11:51.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He'll butcher that\Nbullshitting beautician!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.74,0:11:54.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This seems like an\Nexcellent place to start.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.90,0:12:00.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sunny, you can't use\Na flash near the baby.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.50,0:12:01.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This isn't good, Josuke.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.38,0:12:05.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The stress is triggering her\Npowers and she's disappearing.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.68,0:12:06.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's go, old man!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.92,0:12:08.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We gotta get out of here!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.64,0:12:10.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Our nest is coming through!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.20,0:12:11.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Move it, people!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.11,0:12:11.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Out of the way!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.28,0:12:13.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's happening?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.54,0:12:16.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sorry about that, Koichi!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.92,0:12:26.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wowsers, Yukako...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.72,0:12:29.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Koichi...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.60,0:12:34.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She was right.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.94,0:12:37.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The tables have turned in my favor.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.26,0:12:44.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Our willing hearts beat as one, and our\Nsouls are intertwined in a magical dance.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.86,0:12:48.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nothing else matters\Nbut us and this moment.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.10,0:12:50.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My new life begins now.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.92,0:12:52.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can feel it.
