Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.78,0:13:14.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Run that by me again?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.48,0:13:15.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What'd she do to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.74,0:13:17.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you going to have to\Nteach her another lesson?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.82,0:13:18.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whoa, take it easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.12,0:13:20.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You've got it all wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.60,0:13:21.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She didn't do anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.16,0:13:25.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If I'm being honest, I think\NI've fallen for Yukako.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.68,0:13:30.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She's grown on me, and I get excited\Nthinking about spending time with her.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.62,0:13:32.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She makes me feel all warm and fuzzy.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.74,0:13:35.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Could this be love? I'm so confused.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.08,0:13:36.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yo, are you catching all of this, Okuyasu?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.88,0:13:39.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This gushy stuff would\Nshock the pants off a stand.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.58,0:13:41.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Those two playing tongue hockey?
