Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.04,0:13:46.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Pull it together.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.46,0:13:48.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's weird, but it's nothing to cry about.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.56,0:13:49.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Anyway, Koichi,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.18,0:13:53.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't have the faintest clue as to what\Nspawned this stunning change of heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.86,0:13:54.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But hey,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.77,0:13:58.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,if you and Yukako are really into each\Nother, then I wish you both the best of luck.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.94,0:14:01.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thanks, but that's not the problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.62,0:14:05.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't know what's going on with\Nher, but she's refusing to see me.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.94,0:14:07.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's all so baffling.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.90,0:14:10.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She's been absent from\Nschool for two days.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.16,0:14:12.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She won't answer the phone\Nor say a single word.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.60,0:14:14.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She's off the grid, but how come?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.06,0:14:17.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wow, so she went AWOL\Nafter you guys kissed?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.66,0:14:19.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And you haven't talked to her since?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.46,0:14:20.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not a word.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.06,0:14:21.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh-oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.97,0:14:24.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The silent treatment's a real bad sign.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.34,0:14:25.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's a shame, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.78,0:14:29.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I admired her crazy devotion, but\Nghosting you like this is so uncool.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.24,0:14:31.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's gonna be awkward as hell,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.84,0:14:35.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but I think your best bet is asking\NYukako about it face-to-face.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.40,0:14:38.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, bud, but we\Nshouldn't get involved in this.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.88,0:14:39.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.58,0:14:43.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But if things turn ugly, give\Nus a holler and we'll rush over!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.94,0:14:45.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'll be there to help before you know it!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.68,0:14:46.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thanks, guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.02,0:14:48.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll see you both later.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.24,0:14:49.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,See ya.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.92,0:14:52.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But still, damn that Koichi.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.30,0:14:53.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why does he get to kiss a girl?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.48,0:14:54.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Calm down.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.39,0:14:56.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're freaking out over nothing again.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.38,0:15:03.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'd know that hair anywhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.88,0:15:04.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yukako!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.90,0:15:07.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please, wait up. We need to talk.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.78,0:15:10.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yukako?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.20,0:15:17.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.11,0:15:18.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't know who you're referring to.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.02,0:15:20.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, my mistake.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.64,0:15:23.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I saw your hair and thought\Nyou were someone I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.26,0:15:33.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.17,0:15:34.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't want you to go!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.22,0:15:39.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, Koichi!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.92,0:15:58.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why the hell would you do this\Nto me, you conniving trowel?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.10,0:16:02.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My face is falling apart and your stupid\Nmakeup just cracks and flecks away!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.88,0:16:06.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Damn you!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.08,0:16:08.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're a backstabbing bitch!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.02,0:16:10.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Turn my face back to normal!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.92,0:16:13.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Foolish girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.50,0:16:16.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Seems you didn't follow my instructions.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.86,0:16:19.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's such a shame.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.66,0:16:22.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I truly thought I'd impressed\Nupon you the importance
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.46,0:16:25.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,of applying the Cinderella\Nlipstick every 30 minutes.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.62,0:16:27.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So this is my punishment for forgetting?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.48,0:16:30.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What is this? My hands!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.44,0:16:32.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the hell is wrong with them?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.26,0:16:35.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The skin on my hands is breaking down!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.70,0:16:38.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your palm lines and\Nfingerprints are disappearing.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.32,0:16:40.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's what happens when\Nyou don't follow orders.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.62,0:16:44.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That lipstick was an assurance of good\Nfortune during your quest for love.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.30,0:16:49.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tremendous energy is required to\Nchange the course of one's destiny.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.16,0:16:50.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And it's all used up.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.22,0:16:55.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You've only yourself to blame for\Nnot taking your destiny seriously.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.38,0:16:57.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, do you want to die?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.44,0:16:58.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Die, you say?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.92,0:17:03.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ambition and wealth aren't my only\Nmotivating factors, so save the intimidation.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.48,0:17:06.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I modeled myself after\Nthe Fairy Godmother.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.40,0:17:09.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She was a sorceress of the highest\Nlevel and bringer of happiness.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.86,0:17:12.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It really is such a shame.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.56,0:17:16.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's clear to me now that I never should\Nhave tried to make your wish come true.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.44,0:17:18.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your face and palms are long gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.98,0:17:21.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They've been erased from this world.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.32,0:17:22.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What did you say?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.18,0:17:24.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That they're gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.70,0:17:27.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And who has use for\Nthings with missing parts?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.68,0:17:28.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My face.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.92,0:17:30.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's gone forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.76,0:17:31.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This isn't fair.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.00,0:17:34.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How am I supposed to\Nlive my life like this?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.34,0:17:35.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yukako!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.34,0:17:38.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's Koichi!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.44,0:17:40.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why is he here?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.78,0:17:42.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't let him learn my secret!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.60,0:17:45.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, I'm afraid not.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.40,0:17:47.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sorry, but you've got the wrong person.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.06,0:17:48.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Dr.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.97,0:17:51.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Aya, your beauty institute\Nis for women only, correct?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.92,0:17:53.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I want him out of here now.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.30,0:17:58.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nice try, but you can't fool me.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.10,0:18:01.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'd know that tough as\NNils' temperament anywhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.52,0:18:03.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now I know for sure you're Yukako.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.30,0:18:07.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your personality leaves\Na real strong impression.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.76,0:18:11.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And this lady, she's a\Nstand user, is that right?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.50,0:18:14.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,From what I'm gathering,\Nshe did something to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.62,0:18:17.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's all over.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.22,0:18:18.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't live like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.50,0:18:22.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You'll pay for this, Aya Tsuji.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.34,0:18:23.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna murder you!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.22,0:18:25.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't give in to despair.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.98,0:18:31.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the hell?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.34,0:18:34.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Part of her face flew off and\Nis flying around the room!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.28,0:18:35.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There we go.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.30,0:18:39.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So this is Koichi.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.30,0:18:44.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He saw through your altered state\Nand identified you as Yukako.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.42,0:18:47.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You tried denying\Nyourself in front of him,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.28,0:18:51.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but some people just have\Nan eye for character.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.48,0:18:52.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right, Yukako.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.80,0:18:55.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Out of consideration for\Nthis young man's efforts,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.72,0:18:58.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll give you one final\Nchance as a fairy godmother.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.82,0:19:01.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Select one of these faces.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.84,0:19:04.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You have one chance, so choose wisely.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.24,0:19:07.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Know that your original face is no more.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.60,0:19:10.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But Cinderella remembers the\Nface of each patient that
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.54,0:19:13.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,has made use of its ability\Nand can replicate them.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.02,0:19:17.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now, pick your own face\Nfrom among the samples.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.36,0:19:21.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you can find it, there's a chance\Nyour original features could be restored.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.58,0:19:23.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your palms and fingerprints, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.82,0:19:27.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Much like Cinderella and\Nher famous glass slipper,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.88,0:19:30.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I invite you to find your perfect fit.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.74,0:19:32.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why didn't you say that earlier, Dr.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.78,0:19:33.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Dumbass?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.69,0:19:35.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll be out of here in no time flat!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.46,0:19:38.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I look in the mirror every\Nday, so how hard can this be?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.10,0:19:40.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't get cocky.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.40,0:19:42.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you choose someone else's face,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.36,0:19:45.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,it'll clash with your own\Nas you might have imagined.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.16,0:19:47.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Actually, why sugarcoat the truth?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.36,0:19:51.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As an authority on all things beauty, I\Ncan say your face will become grotesque.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.44,0:19:53.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No one will want to look at it.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.92,0:19:57.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's more, the contours of your\Nface will dictate your destiny.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.52,0:20:05.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, Yukako, be extra careful.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.92,0:20:08.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Remember, your face is reversed\Nwhen you look in a mirror.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.00,0:20:10.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, you're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.84,0:20:12.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Poor girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.32,0:20:15.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Truth is, none of the faces are correct.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.96,0:20:17.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Every one is a fake.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.58,0:20:21.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you can figure that out,\NI'll return your face to normal.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.36,0:20:24.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That is the fairy\Ngodmother's rule. Damn it.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.88,0:20:28.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The more I look at them, the\Nmore they look like my face.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.72,0:20:30.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But this is the one.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.34,0:20:31.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It has to be.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.68,0:20:34.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No way I'd be able to forget my own face.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.62,0:20:35.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You sure about that?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.84,0:20:38.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Once you try it on, you'll know for sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.60,0:20:52.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, I'm wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.92,0:20:54.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This isn't the right face.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.50,0:20:58.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I almost missed it, but my eyes\Nhave more of a slant than these do.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.44,0:20:59.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Which one is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.76,0:21:00.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have no idea!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.08,0:21:03.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What if I make the wrong decision?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.92,0:21:09.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.96,0:21:12.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You have a face to\Nchoose, so get to picking.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.98,0:21:14.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, I won't.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.50,0:21:16.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I refuse to choose. But why?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.18,0:21:18.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So what are you saying?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.66,0:21:21.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You want to live out\Nyour life without a face.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.08,0:21:23.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm saying I want Koichi to choose.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.98,0:21:28.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That way, it'll be a face Koichi can love.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.14,0:21:30.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I couldn't care less what it looks like!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.40,0:21:33.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And the amount of luck it has\Ndoesn't mean a thing to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.26,0:21:34.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll bear with the outcome.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.96,0:21:37.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And live a life free of regret?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.16,0:21:39.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But what if I get it\Nwrong? What will you do?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.94,0:21:42.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll deal with it.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.40,0:21:46.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please, Koichi!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.54,0:21:47.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,For me.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.56,0:21:59.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Here, this is it.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.96,0:22:01.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't tell you why I chose it.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.90,0:22:03.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I guess it's just intuition.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.76,0:22:06.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But if I did mess up and\Nchoose the wrong face...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.88,0:22:11.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, by the way, this guy's\Nmy stand, Reverb. Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.00,0:22:17.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So anyway, if I screw up, I want you to\Nwound Reverb's eyes and blind me for life.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.50,0:22:22.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know you said you wouldn't have any\Nregrets, But knowing you like I do now,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.82,0:22:24.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you'd secretly get really\Nupset if I couldn't
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.98,0:22:27.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,see you just the way you've always been.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.20,0:22:30.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And though I couldn't see it\Nbefore, I'm in love with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.30,0:22:32.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I couldn't bear to see you unhappy.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.62,0:22:36.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's why the best solution would\Nbe for me to never see again.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.02,0:22:41.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Koichi.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.10,0:22:43.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Here, Yukako.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.68,0:22:44.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.96,0:22:58.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.87,0:23:00.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's a perfect fit!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.28,0:23:01.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's amazing!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.92,0:23:02.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Koichi!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.88,0:23:04.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, we did it, Yukako!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.54,0:23:06.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's all because you were\Nbrave enough to choose my face!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.04,0:23:11.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,To think he'd sooner blind himself than\Nwitness his beloved suffer unhappiness.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.96,0:23:15.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I figured as very godmother, I'd bend\Nthe rules and give them a happy ending.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.02,0:23:19.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,After all, if I stole the\Neyesight of an innocent young man,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.74,0:23:22.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,what kind of fairy godmother would I be?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.44,0:23:26.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You Kick dear, young as you are, you\Nhave a keen eye for finding good men.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.98,0:23:31.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Beauty Institute Cinderella\Nis open for business.
